# Ashdig - a vehicle island (VI1, quest island)
# A volcanic island of black rock where a small mine dug for ore on a terrace above the sea: an ore train of three
# wagons on a sleeper track, an excavator at the cut face, a light crane over the spoil heap and screechers nesting
# on the peak. Three sample boxes stand by the cut. Quest "The Last Load" (6 steps): the dig, the foreman's tally,
# two screechers, three ore samples, the samples loaded on the lead wagon, the assay box that drops from the crane.
#
# Points (metres from the land centre): the terrace round 6 0 (h 4), the track along z -3 from -2 to 12, the
# excavator 13 5, the crane -2 6, the peak round -10 8, the landing beach 4 -24.
include lib_sea
new
gen Trees=0.1 Bushes=0.18 Rocks=0.5 Harvest=0.1 BeachThings=0.2
gen Seed=15105 Radius=30 Height=14 Roughness=0.55 Peaks=1 Shape=0.4 Style=4 PeakShape=0.6 Cliffs=0.6 BeachWidth=0.35
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.5 SeaFinds=0.2 Sunken=0.1 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0.2
generate

# --- Terrain: the terrace, the track down, the landing ------------------------------------------------------------
brush flatten at 6 0 r=11 s=20 frames=150 h=4
brush flatten at 5 -9 r=4 s=20 frames=80 h=3.2
brush flatten at 4 -15 r=4 s=20 frames=80 h=2.2
brush flatten at 4 -24 r=6 s=20 frames=100 h=1.1
brush sand at 4 -24 r=6 s=10 frames=30
origin
clear at 6 0 r=10
clear at 4 -24 r=5

# --- The ore train on its sleepers, the excavator, the crane ------------------------------------------------------
line FL_Plank1 from -2 -3 to 12 -3 step=1.2 yaw=90 sit
place VP_Wagon01 leadwagon at 10 -3 ground sit yaw=90
place VP_Wagon02 - at 7.6 -3 ground sit yaw=90
place VP_Wagon02 - at 4.8 -3 ground sit yaw=90
place VP_Excavator - at 13 5 ground sit yaw=250
place UT_ElectricityIsland_Crane02 - at -1 6 ground y=-1.5 sit scale=0.45 yaw=200
place Loot_ChestSmall assaybox at 1 3 ground sit yaw=160

# --- The cut: sample boxes, the tally, the ore -------------------------------------------------------------------
place Loot_ChestSmall sample1 at 8 2 ground sit yaw=180
place Loot_ChestSmall sample2 at 10 1.5 ground sit yaw=170
place Loot_ChestSmall sample3 at 12 1 ground sit yaw=190
place Note_Board tally at 3 -6 ground sit yaw=180
place Placeable_Lantern_Metal - at 2 -6 ground sit
place VP_MetalCrate02 - at -1 -1 ground sit yaw=15
place VP_ExplosiveBarrel_Pile - at 15 -2 ground sit yaw=40
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Iron 1" 3 at 12 8 r=4 seed=15151 free=1.5
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Copper 1" 2 at -12 -4 r=5 seed=15152 free=2
place Creature_StoneBird screechers at -10 8 ground
prop screechers creature.count=2
prop screechers creature.respawn=0
place Zone_Trigger digzone at 5 -5 ground
call shallows x=0 z=0 r=38 deep=5 n=1 seed=15153

# --- Settings, notes, quest ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
info title=Ashdig
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A small ore mine on a black volcanic island: an ore train of three wagons, an excavator at the cut, a light crane and screechers on the peak.
island on.arrive=message||Black rock and the smell of sulphur. On a terrace above the beach, three ore wagons wait on a track that goes nowhere.

story oresample|Ore sample|Bolt|A bagged ore sample from the boxes by the cut.
story loaded|Last load|Bolt|The three ore samples, loaded on the lead wagon.

note tally Foreman's tally | ASHDIG - FOREMAN'S TALLY\n\nThree samples left to send. They are in the boxes by the cut.\nLoad them on the lead wagon, then the assay box comes down off the crane hook - that is how the crew got paid.\nMind the screechers on the peak. They take anything that shines.
note sample1 First sample box | One bagged ore sample.
loot sample1 story:oresample*1;Stone*2
prop sample1 loot.refill=0
note sample2 Second sample box | One bagged ore sample.
loot sample2 story:oresample*1;Clay*2
prop sample2 loot.refill=0
note sample3 Third sample box | One bagged ore sample.
loot sample3 story:oresample*1;Sand*2
prop sample3 loot.refill=0
note assaybox Assay box | The assay box: the crew's pay in metal.
loot assaybox MetalIngot*4;CopperIngot*2;TitaniumOre*1
prop assaybox loot.refill=0
prop assaybox obj.name=assaybox
prop assaybox beh.hidden=1

prop leadwagon obj.name=leadwagon
prop leadwagon beh.use=Load the ore samples
prop leadwagon if.use=take|story:oresample|3
prop leadwagon on.use=message||The three sample bags thump into the wagon. Up on the crane, the hook slips its catch and the assay box drops onto the rock below it.\ngive||story:loaded*1\nshow|assaybox
prop leadwagon else.use=message||The lead wagon waits for its load: three ore samples. The tally says where they are.

prop digzone zone.id=dig
prop digzone zone.radius=5
prop digzone zone.message=The dig on Ashdig. An ore train, an excavator, a crane - and a tally board by the track.

quest title=The Last Load
quest intro=Somebody dug for ore on Ashdig. Find the dig.
step reach|dig|1|Climb to the dig on the terrace
step read|Foreman's tally|1|Read the foreman's tally
step kill|Screecher|2|Drive off the two screechers
step collect|story:oresample|3|Collect the three ore samples by the cut
step collect|story:loaded|1|Load the samples on the lead wagon
step open|Assay box|1|Open the assay box under the crane
quest done=The last load is on the wagon. The crew's pay is yours.
quest reward=MetalIngot*2;ExplosivePowder*2

save Ashdig
